# ── Type: EdgeInstance (CVT — reified edge with full epistemic envelope) ─────
# Double-encoding: direct quad kept for traversal speed; EdgeInstance node
# carries weight, direction, epistemic state, scope, provenance.
# Follows Freebase CVT pattern. Edge identity is deterministic (sha1 of
# subject|predicate|object) so re-asserting the same edge is idempotent.
